# Paths excluded from the codebase-memory index.
#
# Why: the vendored skill bundles are tooling, not application code. Indexing them
# accounted for 83.5% of the graph (1318 of 1579 nodes in the graphify run), which
# turned the "god nodes" list into impeccable internals (resumeSession, connectSSE)
# instead of Asteria's own abstractions, and duplicated every community because the
# bundle exists at both .agent/skills/ and .agents/skills/.
.agent/skills/
.agents/
artifacts/
graphify-out/
temp/
